            "review_title": "Review at Sea High Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Daniela D\n21 contributions\n0\nHidden gem\nOct 2024 • Family\nThis is definitely a hidden gem. They have a great menu, delicious meals (the seafood in a pan is amazing, so good!), awesome service with a smile, beautiful location and lively atmosphere. We've eaten here a couple of times as a family and with friends during our stay in Nha Trang.\nWritten October 17, 2024",
